267 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(The Low FODMAP approach is a structured dietary strategy designed to help identify foods that may contribute to digestive symptoms. Rather than focusing on permanent restriction, it provides a step-by-step process for better understanding individual food tolerances and digestive responses.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

268 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(The approach consists of three phases that work together to identify potential triggers, assess tolerance levels, and build a more personalized eating pattern. Each phase has a specific purpose and helps guide the transition toward greater digestive comfort and long-term dietary variety.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

